# Story sentences for finding a patient and moving around their record.

Phrase: <user> opens the patient list
  As <user>:
    go to patients page
    "account menu" button should be visible       # the app has finished loading

Phrase: <user> searches for "<text>"
  As <user>:
    type "<text>" in "Filter by name or patient ID"

Phrase: <user> opens the record of "<patient>"
  As <user>:
    click "<patient>" link

Phrase: <user> opens the "<tab>" tab
  As <user>:
    in "Patient record", click "<tab>"

Phrase: <user> selects tooth <n>
  As <user>:
    in "Tooth chart", click "Tooth <n>"
